1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,298
一把剑，悬在她的指尖前
One sword hovers at her fingertips.

2
00:00:04,958 --> 00:00:08,522
剑诀一起，第二把、第一百把
She forms the seal, and a second, a hundredth,

3
00:00:08,522 --> 00:00:11,863
第一万把，从云海里升起来
a ten-thousandth sword rise out of the clouds.

4
00:00:13,123 --> 00:00:17,350
一万把剑，每一把都要飞、要躲、要出手
Ten thousand swords, and every one has to fly, dodge and strike.

5
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,161
游戏要怎么算？
How does a game compute that?

6
00:00:20,861 --> 00:00:25,637
终章，我们把前四期的招式，合成一套御剑术
For the finale, we combine the moves of the last four episodes into one art of sword flight.

7
00:00:27,737 --> 00:00:30,740
剑群的飞行，就是第一期的鸟群算法
The swords fly with the flocking algorithm from episode one.

8
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,834
每把剑只看身边最近的几把
Each sword looks only at its nearest few:

9
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:36,536
太近就分开，方向和同伴对齐
too close, move apart; match your neighbours' heading;

10
00:00:36,536 --> 00:00:38,901
再加一股绕着她旋转的力
and add one more force that circles around her.

11
00:00:39,561 --> 00:00:43,537
三条局部规则，就转出了一道升天的剑旋风
Three local rules spin up a whirlwind of swords.

12
00:00:43,537 --> 00:00:46,610
找邻居，用的还是那张空间网格
Neighbours are still found with the same spatial grid.

13
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,813
敌人来了：六千把赤红飞剑
Then the enemy arrives: six thousand crimson swords.

14
00:00:51,873 --> 00:00:54,482
每把剑都是一个实体
Every sword is an entity:

15
00:00:54,482 --> 00:00:58,179
位置、速度、角色、目标、弯曲
position, velocity, role, target, bend,

16
00:00:58,179 --> 00:01:00,136
各存一列数组
each stored as its own array column.

17
00:01:00,696 --> 00:01:02,590
角色系统分配任务
A role system hands out jobs:

18
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:05,861
有的直取敌人本体，有的去截击来剑
some go straight for the enemy, some intercept incoming swords,

19
00:01:05,861 --> 00:01:08,272
剩下的在她身前结成剑盾
and the rest form a shield in front of her.

20
00:01:08,832 --> 00:01:11,773
每一帧，系统挨个扫过这些数组
Each frame, the systems sweep through those arrays one by one.

21
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:17,097
两把剑相撞时，碰撞系统算出撞击的方向和力度
When two swords collide, the collision system works out the direction and force of the hit

22
00:01:17,097 --> 00:01:18,606
写进弯曲组件
and writes them into the bend component.

23
00:01:19,266 --> 00:01:22,090
真正把剑压弯的是顶点着色器
The bending itself happens in the vertex shader:

24
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:24,208
越靠近剑尖弯得越多
the closer to the tip, the more it bends,

25
00:01:24,208 --> 00:01:27,914
再叠一段衰减的正弦，就是撞击后的颤动
and a decaying sine wave on top is the ringing after the hit.

26
00:01:28,474 --> 00:01:32,223
和第二期《ABZÛ》让鱼身摆动，是同一招
It's the same trick ABZÛ uses to make a fish's body swim, from episode two.

27
00:01:33,723 --> 00:01:38,277
一万六千把剑，CPU 每帧只上传位置、方向和弯曲
Sixteen thousand swords: each frame the CPU uploads only position, direction and bend,

28
00:01:38,277 --> 00:01:40,132
每把六十四个字节
sixty-four bytes per sword.

29
00:01:40,692 --> 00:01:42,895
剑尖朝哪、剑身怎么转
Which way the tip points and how the blade turns

30
00:01:42,895 --> 00:01:44,929
交给顶点着色器去算
are left to the vertex shader.

31
00:01:45,489 --> 00:01:49,600
所有剑一次绘制，剑光和火花各再加一次
All the swords take one draw call, plus one each for the trails and the sparks.

32
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:51,978
她剑诀前推
She drives the seal forward.

33
00:01:53,638 --> 00:01:56,747
一万把剑同时转向，汇成一条剑河
Ten thousand swords turn at once, merging into a river of blades

34
00:01:56,747 --> 00:01:58,820
击碎对方的护体剑气
that shatters the enemy's guarding aura.

35
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:02,755
被打弯的红剑，一把把坠进云海
The bent red swords drop, one by one, into the sea of clouds.

36
00:02:04,655 --> 00:02:05,274
收剑
Sheathe.

37
00:02:07,134 --> 00:02:09,322
弯掉的剑在归途上慢慢回直
On the way back, the bent swords slowly straighten,

38
00:02:09,322 --> 00:02:11,511
每一把都回到它出发的位置
and each one returns to exactly where it set out.

39
00:02:13,211 --> 00:02:16,336
五期下来：局部规则、空间网格
Five episodes: local rules, a spatial grid,

40
00:02:16,336 --> 00:02:19,829
实例化和顶点动画、数据和逻辑分开
instancing and vertex animation, data kept apart from logic,

41
00:02:19,829 --> 00:02:22,402
再把能算的交给 GPU
and everything computable handed to the GPU.

42
00:02:23,062 --> 00:02:28,268
一只鸟、一条鱼、一个僵尸、一块板、一把剑
A bird, a fish, a zombie, a panel, a sword:

43
00:02:28,268 --> 00:02:32,116
变成一万个，用的是同一套办法
turning one into ten thousand takes the same set of moves.

44
00:02:33,176 --> 00:02:35,974
而这一切，都从一把剑开始
And all of it begins with a single sword.
